---
title: Clients and references
layout: page.njk
wide: true
permalink: /clients/
description: "Sample clients, policy work, teaching, expert networks, cooperation partners and media partners of Dr Michael Salmony and Payments Innovation Consulting."
---
<p>All 5-star references (available on request).</p>
{%- set sections = [
  ["clients", "Sample clients"],
  ["policy", "Sample policy work"],
  ["teaching", "Sample teaching"],
  ["experts", "Sample expert networks"],
  ["partners", "Sample cooperation partners"],
  ["media", "Sample media and communication partners"]
] %}
{%- for s in sections %}
<h2>{{ s[1] }}</h2>
<ul class="logo-wall">
{%- for c in clients[s[0]] %}
  <li class="{% if c.wide %}wide{% endif %}{% if c.notes %} has-notes{% endif %}">{% if c.url %}<a href="{{ c.url }}">{% endif %}{% if c.logo %}<img src="{{ c.logo }}" alt="{{ c.name }}" loading="lazy">{% if c.showname %}<span class="logo-name">{{ c.displayname or c.name }}</span>{% endif %}{% else %}<span class="logo-text">{{ c.name }}</span>{% endif %}{% if c.url %}</a>{% endif %}{% if c.notes %}<span class="logo-notes{% if c.notes.length > 1 %} several{% endif %}">{% for n in c.notes %}<span>{{ n }}</span>{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}{% if c.countries %}<span class="logo-country">{% for k in c.countries %}<span><img src="/assets/img/flags/{{ k[0] }}.svg" alt="" width="20" height="15">{{ k[1] }}</span>{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}</li>
{%- endfor %}
</ul>
{%- endfor %}
